What this license covers

The work this project adds:

- The crosswalk between INALI groups, ISO 639-3 codes and Glottocodes
  (inali_groups.csv, crosswalk.csv, crosswalk_members.csv,
  member_overrides.csv, unresolved.csv).
- The weekly snapshots in snapshots/: the counts and states this project
  measured, and how they were measured.
- The structured files this project derived from published documents, as
  a compilation: variants.csv, variant_ipa.csv, variant_localities.csv,
  risk_grade.csv, and the hand-maintained alias, correction and review
  files beside them.
- The files in reference/ in the form this project gives them.

